# Accepted text-check findings. One entry per line:
#   rule | file pattern | word (optional) | reason
# The rule is required and cannot be *. tools/text_check.py has the rules.

# The design document names game parts and actions with -ing words
# (Breeding pod, heating towers, Packing). Renaming them would change the
# design.
ing-form | docs/design.md | | names of game parts and actions in the design
ing-form | locale/en/locale.cfg | breeding | the name of the breeding pod
ing-form | CHANGELOG.md | loading | the name of the loading chamber
ing-form | ROADMAP.md | loading | the name of the loading chamber
ing-form | art/BRIEF-*.md | | names of game parts (Breeding pod, Loading chamber)
ing-form | docs/superpowers/specs/*-lifecycle-design.md | | names of game parts and research (Breeding pod, Sulfur processing)
ing-form | docs/superpowers/specs/*-ordnance-design.md | | names of game parts and research (Loading chamber, Ordnance loading, the Launching notes)
ing-form | docs/superpowers/specs/*-launcher-design.md | | names of game parts and events (Casing, Landing, Spoiling, Ordnance loading)
ing-form | docs/superpowers/specs/*-feral-design.md | | names of game events and states (Going feral, Replacing a unit)
ing-form | docs/superpowers/specs/*-payload-damage-design.md | | names of game events (landing blast)
ing-form | docs/superpowers/specs/*-v1-graphics-design.md | | names of game parts and prototypes (Breeding pod, assembling machine 3)

# The review reports record what reviewers said and quote the old spec,
# including its American spellings.
spelling | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | color | quotes the old spec
spelling | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | behavior | quotes the old spec
ing-form | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording
passive | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording
perfect-tense | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording
sentence-length | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording
word | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording
paragraph-length | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording
modal-passive | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording

# The plan follows the writing-plans format ("Modify:" in file lists) and
# the functional-core work loop, which defines "attempt".
word | docs/superpowers/plans/*.md | modify | the writing-plans file-list format
word | docs/superpowers/plans/*.md | attempt | a term the work loop defines
word | docs/superpowers/plans/*.md | utilize | the planted mistake for the checker test
ing-form | docs/superpowers/plans/*-ordnance.md | | names of game parts and research (Loading chamber, Ordnance loading)
ing-form | docs/superpowers/plans/*-launcher.md | | names of game parts and steps (Mining, Spawning, landing, casing, Ruling)
ing-form | docs/superpowers/plans/*-feral.md | | names of game events (Going feral, going feral)
perfect-tense | docs/superpowers/plans/*-launcher.md | | test notes about a projectile in flight
word | docs/superpowers/plans/*-launcher.md | unlock | quotes a test name from spec/core/prototypes/ordnance_spec.lua
ing-form | locale/en/locale.cfg | loading | the names of the Loading chamber and Ordnance loading
phrasal-verb | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording
progressive | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording
vague-association | docs/superpowers/reviews/*.md | | records the reviewers' wording

# Names of a Space Age planet and a proposed item in the design.
spelling | docs/superpowers/*/*.md | railgun | Space Age weapon name
spelling | docs/superpowers/*/*.md | railgun's | Space Age weapon name
ing-form | docs/superpowers/specs/*-stasis-design.md | | names of recipes and actions (Packing, Unpacking, spoiling)

# The payload damage plan names its throwaway probe folder and its
# look-alike prototypes (plural "look-alikes").
spelling | docs/superpowers/plans/*-payload-damage.md | scratchpad | the throwaway probe folder
spelling | docs/superpowers/plans/*-payload-damage.md | alikes | the plural of look-alike

# Credits name the artists as they sign their work.
spelling | THIRD_PARTY.md | snouz | an artist's name
spelling | THIRD_PARTY.md | Panglia | the name of snouz's mods
spelling | THIRD_PARTY.md | hlittlezero | an artist's name
spelling | THIRD_PARTY.md | Hlittlezero | the lettering on the original sprites
spelling | docs/superpowers/specs/*-v1-graphics-design.md | snouz | an artist's name
spelling | docs/superpowers/specs/*-v1-graphics-design.md | Panglia | the name of snouz's mods
spelling | docs/superpowers/specs/*-v1-graphics-design.md | hlittlezero | an artist's name
spelling | docs/superpowers/specs/*-v1-graphics-design.md | Hlittlezero | the lettering on the original sprites
spelling | docs/superpowers/specs/*-v1-graphics-design.md | Nullius | the name of the mod that repacked the oxidizer
